  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NP: Habitat for Humanity NZ (HFHNZ) - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Negotiated Partnership with Habitat for Humanity New Zealand (HFHNZ) to deliver a five-year housing resilience programme across Fiji, Samoa and Tonga. In this activity, c&lt;span&gt;ommunities will be supported &lt;/span&gt;to strengthen climate-resilient housing, improve Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (WASH) systems, and build local leadership for inclusive and sustainable development through&#xa0;vocational and plumbing training for women and youth, transitional shelter upgrades, and community-led resilience planning.</narrative>
  </description>
